    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "S-waves cannot pass through liquid media, which conclusively proves that the Outer Core is in a liquid/molten state.",
        "The NIFE layer (Nickel and Iron) forms the Earth's Core, while SIAL (Silica-Aluminium) and SIMA (Silica-Magnesium) form the Crust.",
        "Key boundaries: Mohorovicic discontinuity lies between Crust and Mantle; Gutenberg discontinuity lies between Mantle and Core."
      ],
